sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as Admin API
  participant C as Correction Service
  participant R as Review Service
  participant O as Override Manager
  participant D as Canonical Store
  participant P as Publication

  U->>A: create correction
  A->>C: validate and save draft
  U->>A: submit
  A->>R: request review
  R-->>A: approved
  A->>O: activate override
  O->>D: apply effective value
  O->>P: publish changed snapshot
